<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <style>
        .button {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            border: none;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px 32px;
            text-align: center;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-block;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin: 4px 2px;
            cursor: pointer;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <h2>Welcome to the Bootcamp Management System!</h2>
    <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
    <p>An Admin has added you as a <strong>Teacher</strong> for the following:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Bootcamp:</strong> {{bootcampName}}</li>
        <li><strong>Domain:</strong> {{domainName}}</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Your account has been created[cite: 134]. Before you can access your dashboard to manage assignments and student
        progress, please set your password[cite: 135, 161].</p>

    <a href="{{setupPasswordLink}}" class="button">Set Your Password</a>

    <p>If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link: {{setupPasswordLink}}</p>
    <p>Best regards,<br>BMS Administration</p>
</body>

</html>